// 好学（好学吕蒙）：锁定技。出牌阶段内，你获得牌后回复 1 点体力；
// 出牌阶段外，你弃置牌后失去 1 点体力。
// 上游 (collab/skill.js haoxue)：forced；trigger player gainAfter/loseAfter +
// global loseAsyncAfter；isPhaseUsing → getg(player).length && isDamaged → recover；
// else type==discard → getl(player).cards2.length → loseHp。
// 实现（2026-09-03 第一百四十七批·零新原语真实语义重写）：
// 获得臂按事件源拆双臂（cards_drawn 摸牌 / cards_moved 入手牌区——触发注册按事件键
// 路由，单一 cards_moved 臂收不到 CardsDrawn）+ cards_moved 流失臂；过滤器
// owner_gained_cards_during_play_phase_wounded / owner_discarded_outside_play_phase
// 本批注册。完整建模，无残差。
skill haoxue(4229967180) {
  trigger cards_drawn owner_gained_cards_during_play_phase_wounded {
    effect recover_hp(self, 1);
  }
  trigger cards_moved owner_gained_cards_during_play_phase_wounded {
    effect recover_hp(self, 1);
  }
  trigger cards_moved owner_discarded_outside_play_phase {
    effect lose_hp(self, 1);
  }
}
